{"created": "2026-11-11T21:12:39.398271+00:00", "modified": "2026-11-11T21:12:39.778438+00:00", "id": 24146382, "conceptrecid": "24146381", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24146382", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.24146381", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146382", "metadata": {"title": "nhanes-bioimpedance", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24146382", "publication_date": "2026-11-11", "description": "<p>This repository refits the full 50-frequency bioimpedance spectra from NHANES 1999-2004 (about 13,000 Americans aged 8 to 49) and asks whether the whole spectrum predicts outcomes better than the 50 kHz phase angle that published studies use.</p><p>Status: pilot, claimed, not peer reviewed.</p><p>Claimed findings include that refitting all 13,276 spectra reproduces CDC's Cole parameters; that a 50 kHz equation predicts DXA lean mass with R^2 \u2248 0.96 on a held-out survey cycle while the full spectrum adds 0.000-0.002; and that in 5,173 adults aged 20-49, 50 kHz phase angle predicts death (hazard ratio 0.66 per degree, adjusted for age and sex) while the full spectrum adds no consistent discrimination.</p><p>Code in this archive is under the Apache License 2.0. Text and results are under CC BY 4.0. NHANES data are published by CDC/NCHS and are not redistributed here.</p><p>NHANES public-use files and NCHS public-use Linked Mortality Files are not included in this archive. Survey and mortality microdata are downloaded from CDC/NCHS sources listed in the repository and are not committed to git. If you redistribute the raw NHANES files, follow NCHS/CDC citation and redistribution rules. Do not strip NCHS file headers or documentation when redistributing downloaded files. For the Linked Mortality Files, see NCHS data-linkage documentation for permitted use and citation.</p><p>Directed by Ahraz Arifuddin</p><p>Researched and verified by different model families across Gemini, Claude, Grok, OpenAI, and Muse</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Arifuddin, Ahraz", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["NHANES", "bioimpedance", "body-composition", "mortality"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/Foundation-0/nhanes-bioimpedance", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "v1.0.0", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Foundation-0/nhanes-bioimpedance"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "apache2.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "24146381"}}]}}, "title": "nhanes-bioimpedance", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146382", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146382", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146382?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146382", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146382", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.24146382", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146382/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146381", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146381", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146381", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.24146381", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:24146382/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:24146382/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146382/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146382/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146382/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/24146382/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146382/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146382/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146382/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/24146382/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo